# skill is Claude-only). When 233 lands, delete the two entries below and regenerate; the
# file itself stays (an empty list is valid). Do NOT add skills here: an adapter makes a
# skill discoverable, not Claude-runnable, and hiding skills from a non-Claude driver is
# the v3.0-182 mistake this list is a stop-gap for (v3.0-236).
cross-check       # still dispatches the Claude->GPT bridge unconditionally; same-vendor from Codex (v3.0-76 class)
cross-check-loop  # same reason as cross-check
